{""kind"": ""source-section"", ""path"": ""/media/endlessblink/data/my-projects/ai-development/content-creation/rough-cut-mvp/MASTER_PLAN.md"", ""line"": 7239, ""endLine"": 7244, ""text"": ""### TASK-236 Editor v2 design spec + mockup, user-approved before any code

**Priority:** P1
**Status:** READY FOR USER SIGN-OFF — visual mockup direction APPROVED by user (2026-06-10);
interaction/playback spec added 2026-06-11
""}

{""kind"": ""source-section"", ""path"": ""/media/endlessblink/data/my-projects/ai-development/bots+automation/bina-meatezvet-bot/docs/MASTER_PLAN.md"", ""line"": 116, ""endLine"": 141, ""text"": ""### TASK-008 - Admin Panel Moderation Surface

**Goal:** Expose moderation evidence and controls to the Bina Meatzevet admin panel.

**Implementation slices:**
1. Finalize JSON API contracts:
   - `GET /admin/events`;
   - `GET /admin/spam`;
   - `GET /admin/actions`;
   - future rule status endpoint.
2. Add summarized moderation cards:
   - spam detections;
   - deleted messages;
   - removed users;
   - failed WAHA actions.
3. Add filters by group, user, action, reason, date.
4. Add safe manual actions:
   - approve/ignore detection;
   - manually remove from group;
   - disable rule temporarily.

**Acceptance criteria:**
- Admin can see why a user/message was acted on.
- No sensitive webhook payload is shown publicly.
- Manual actions are audited.
""}"

